"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.howItWorksTitle": "AWA Together ikora ite?",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.howItWorksDescription": "Menya uko iyi porogaramu igufasha gufasha uwo mubana ikubahiriza ibanga rye.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.howItWorksParagraph1": "AWA Together ikwemerera kubona gusa amakuru uwo mubana yahisemo kugusangiza.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.howItWorksParagraph2": "Urugero, ushobora kubona amakuru amwe ku kwezi kwe k’imihango, imihango ye itaha cyangwa igihe cye cy’uburumbuke iyo gusangiza byafunguwe.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.howItWorksParagraph3": "Amakuru agaragara buri gihe ashingira ku mahitamo ye. Ashobora guhindura ibyo asangiza igihe cyose.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.hiddenInfoTitle": "Kuki andi makuru yihishwa?",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.hiddenInfoDescription": "Uwo mubana ni we uhitamo ibyo agusangiza. Ashobora guhindura aya mahitamo igihe cyose.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.hiddenInfoParagraph1": "Uwo mubana akomeza kugenzura amakuru yifuza kugusangiza.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.hiddenInfoParagraph2": "Niba amakuru atagaragara mu mwanya wawe, bishobora kuba bivuze gusa ko atahisemo kuyagusangiza.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.hiddenInfoParagraph3": "Amahitamo ye ashobora guhinduka igihe cyose. AWA Together yerekana gusa amakuru wemerewe ubu.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.understandingTitle": "Gusobanukirwa amakuru asangizwa",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.understandingDescription": "Ibisobanuro byoroshye by’umunsi w’ukwezi, intambwe y’ubu, igihe cy’uburumbuke, ovulation iteganyijwe n’imihango itaha.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.understandingIntro": "Dore icyo amakuru ugusangizwa ashobora kuvuga:",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.termCycleDay": "Umunsi w’ukwezi",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.descriptionCycleDay": "Werekana umubare w’iminsi kuva imihango ye ya nyuma yatangira.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.termCurrentPhase": "Intambwe y’ubu",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.descriptionCurrentPhase": "Yerekana urwego ukwezi k’imihango kugezeho iyo bishoboka.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.termFertileWindow": "Igihe cy’uburumbuke",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.descriptionFertileWindow": "Igihe giteganyijwe aho amahirwe yo gusama ashobora kuba menshi.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.termOvulation": "Ovulation iteganyijwe",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.descriptionOvulation": "Iteganya ry’igihe ovulation iba, rishingiye ku makuru aboneka.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.termNextPeriod": "Imihango itaha iteganyijwe",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.descriptionNextPeriod": "Itariki iteganyijwe y’itangira ry’imihango ye itaha.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.termPeriodStatus": "Imimerere y’imihango",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.descriptionPeriodStatus": "Yerekana niba imihango ye iri kuba ubu cyangwa yarangiye.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.troubleshootingTitle": "Mfite ikibazo kuri AWA Together",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.troubleshootingDescription": "Icyo wakora niba amakuru atagaragara, ihuzwa risa n’iryahagaze cyangwa ufite ikindi kibazo.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.troubleshootingParagraph1": "Niba amakuru amwe atagaragara, banza urebe ko interineti yawe ikora neza.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.troubleshootingParagraph2": "Andi makuru ashobora no kubura gusa kubera ko uwo mubana atayasangiza ubu.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.troubleshootingParagraph3": "Ushobora no kugerageza gufunga porogaramu ukongera ukayifungura.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.troubleshootingParagraph4": "Ikibazo nikiramuka gikomeje, uzashobora kuvugana n’ubufasha bwa AWA.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.contactSupportTitle": "Vugana n’ubufasha",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.contactSupportDescription": "Ukeneye ubufasha bwisumbuyeho? Itsinda ryacu rirahari kugufasha.",
"awaADeux.partnerSide.profile.faq.contactSupportParagraph1": "Niba ufite ikibazo, wahuye n’ikibazo cyangwa ushaka kutugezaho igitekerezo, ushobora kuvugana n’itsinda rya AWA uhereye muri iki gice.",
